# Testing bar

- Invariant tests must fail the build when double-entry breaks.
- Golden fixtures: input CSV + expected outcomes under `fixtures/` (expand in Phase 3+).
- Replay/event-hash stability tests belong in store/core (Phase 2+).
- CI (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`) must stay green: fmt, clippy `-D warnings`, test, demo smoke.
- Prefer labeled metrics (precision/recall) over vibe-based claims in docs/eval.
